            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_TV7gJC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Across transportation, manufacturing, warehousing, construction, and public safety sectors, reflective tape plays a crucial role in maintaining visibility where lighting is limited or conditions are unpredictable. Businesses rely on it to highlight vehicles, machinery, pathways, loading areas, and structural hazards so workers and operators can react quickly in real time. Reflective tape also supports compliance with safety regulations and industry standards, ensuring that essential equipment and traffic control elements remain easily identifiable day or night.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
