    "rich_text_fTP44r": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_ygrBx7": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Key Benefits to Using Reflective Tapes For Your Business",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_QAQmiD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Incorporating reflective tape into your facility or fleet enhances safety while improving overall operational efficiency. It helps reduce accidents, equipment damage, and downtime by making critical areas and assets more noticeable. Reflective tape is also a cost-effective solution—it is durable, simple to apply, and engineered to withstand outdoor exposure, harsh temperatures, and demanding work environments. With multiple colors and performance grades available, businesses can customize markings to support organization, workflow clarity, and long-term visibility without frequent maintenance.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
